Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: TOK_PROGRAM TOK_ID Declarations MainBlock
    2        | TOK_PROGRAM TOK_ID MainBlock
    3        | TOK_PROGRAM TOK_ID Declarations

    4 Declarations: Decl
    5             | Declarations Decl

    6 Decl: VarDecl
    7     | StructDecl
    8     | FuncDecl

    9 Type: TOK_INT
   10     | TOK_FLOAT
   11     | TOK_BOOL
   12     | TOK_STRING
   13     | TOK_VOID
   14     | TOK_IMAGE
   15     | TOK_MATRIX
   16     | TOK_KERNEL
   17     | TOK_PIXEL
   18     | ArrayType
   19     | TOK_ID

   20 ArrayType: TOK_ARRAY TOK_LBRACKET Expr TOK_RBRACKET TOK_OF Type
   21          | TOK_ARRAY TOK_LBRACKET Expr TOK_RBRACKET TOK_LBRACKET Expr TOK_RBRACKET TOK_OF Type

   22 OptSemi: TOK_SEMI
   23        | /* empty */

   24 VarDecl: TOK_VAR TOK_ID TOK_COLON Type OptSemi
   25        | TOK_AUTO TOK_ID TOK_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   26        | Type TOK_ID TOK_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi

   27 StructDecl: TOK_STRUCT TOK_ID StructMembers TOK_ENDSTRUCT OptSemi
   28           | TOK_STRUCT TOK_ID TOK_ENDSTRUCT OptSemi

   29 StructMembers: StructMember
   30              | StructMembers StructMember

   31 StructMember: TOK_ID TOK_COLON Type OptSemi

   32 FuncDecl: TOK_FUNCTION TOK_ID TOK_LPAREN ParamList TOK_RPAREN TOK_COLON Type TOK_BEGIN Statements TOK_END OptSemi
   33         | TOK_FUNCTION TOK_ID TOK_LPAREN TOK_RPAREN TOK_COLON Type TOK_BEGIN Statements TOK_END OptSemi
   34         | TOK_FUNCTION TOK_ID TOK_LPAREN ParamList TOK_RPAREN TOK_COLON Type TOK_BEGIN TOK_END OptSemi
   35         | TOK_FUNCTION TOK_ID TOK_LPAREN TOK_RPAREN TOK_COLON Type TOK_BEGIN TOK_END OptSemi

   36 ParamList: Param
   37          | ParamList TOK_COMMA Param

   38 Param: TOK_ID TOK_COLON Type

   39 MainBlock: TOK_MAIN TOK_BEGIN Statements TOK_END OptSemi
   40          | TOK_BEGIN Statements TOK_END OptSemi
   41          | TOK_MAIN TOK_BEGIN TOK_END OptSemi
   42          | TOK_BEGIN TOK_END OptSemi

   43 Statements: Statement
   44           | Statements Statement

   45 Statement: VarDecl
   46          | AssignStmt
   47          | IfStmt
   48          | WhileStmt
   49          | ForStmt
   50          | ForeachStmt
   51          | MatchStmt
   52          | IOStmt
   53          | ReturnStmt
   54          | Expr OptSemi

   55 AssignStmt: LValue TOK_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   56           | LValue TOK_PLUS_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   57           | LValue TOK_MINUS_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   58           | LValue TOK_MULT_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   59           | LValue TOK_DIV_ASSIGN Expr OptSemi
   60           | LValue TOK_INC OptSemi
   61           | LValue TOK_DEC OptSemi

   62 LValue: TOK_ID
   63       | LValue TOK_LBRACKET Expr TOK_RBRACKET
   64       | LValue TOK_DOT TOK_ID

   65 IfStmt: TOK_IF Expr TOK_THEN Statements TOK_ENDIF OptSemi
   66       | TOK_IF Expr TOK_THEN Statements TOK_ELSE Statements TOK_ENDIF OptSemi
   67       | TOK_IF Expr TOK_THEN TOK_ENDIF OptSemi
   68       | TOK_IF Expr TOK_THEN TOK_ELSE Statements TOK_ENDIF OptSemi
   69       | TOK_IF Expr TOK_THEN Statements TOK_ELSE TOK_ENDIF OptSemi

   70 WhileStmt: TOK_WHILE Expr TOK_DO Statements TOK_ENDWHILE OptSemi
   71          | TOK_WHILE Expr TOK_DO TOK_ENDWHILE OptSemi

   72 ForStmt: TOK_FOR LValue TOK_ASSIGN Expr TOK_TO Expr TOK_DO Statements TOK_ENDFOR OptSemi
   73        | TOK_FOR LValue TOK_ASSIGN Expr TOK_TO Expr TOK_DO TOK_ENDFOR OptSemi
   74        | TOK_FOR LValue TOK_ASSIGN Expr TOK_TO Expr TOK_STEP Expr TOK_DO Statements TOK_ENDFOR OptSemi
   75        | TOK_FOR LValue TOK_ASSIGN Expr TOK_TO Expr TOK_STEP Expr TOK_DO TOK_ENDFOR OptSemi

   76 ForeachStmt: TOK_FOREACH TOK_ID TOK_IN Expr TOK_DO Statements TOK_ENDFOR OptSemi
